{"4098290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hexweaver: Onslaught", "steam_appid": 4098290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexweaver: Onslaught</strong> evolves around combining spells.<br>Every spell you cast can trigger other spells on hit, expiration or cast, giving a never ending list of combinations and chains. <br>Build the deadliest combo's to slay your foes, complete events and destroy the level bosses. <br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer and 1 - 4 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters with unique stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps with unique styles and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random spell / powerups drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies and gather their souls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new spells and characters just by playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend souls to unlock permanent upgrades to fight even longer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete boss fights and different types of events to get even more powerfull</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine spells endlessly and improve them with powerups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexweaver: Onslaught</strong> evolves around combining spells.<br>Every spell you cast can trigger other spells on hit, expiration or cast, giving a never ending list of combinations and chains. <br>Build the deadliest combo's to slay your foes, complete events and destroy the level bosses. <br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer and 1 - 4 player online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different characters with unique stats</p></li><li><p cl